# Exploration: "You may play an additional land on each of your turns."
# (CR 305.2). The extra land is optional: Bot1 plays exactly one land on each
# of two consecutive turns and passes, and nothing forces a second land. The
# two-land scenario shows the other answer.

[Bot1 Deck]
Exploration
Mox Emerald
Forest x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Exploration.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
